<title>POLAND: Polish 1997 bond issue likely to be yankee.</title>
<headline>Polish 1997 bond issue likely to be yankee.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's 1997 international bond issue is likely to be placed in the United States if market conditions are right, the finance ministry's debt department director Wieslaw Szczuka said on Friday.</p>
</text>
